        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>Smart city initiatives across the MEA region require deep fibre connectivity reaching municipal facilities, transport corridors and public safety zones. Government entities need networks that are sovereign, auditable and resilient to disruption, with IoT sensor grids feeding real-time data into centralised command centres.</p>
          <p>Cybersecurity is a non-negotiable requirement for public-sector infrastructure. National cybersecurity frameworks mandate data residency, segmented access and continuous monitoring. MEAICON designs infrastructure that meets these obligations while keeping smart city services running around the clock.</p>
